        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Thuanc e Kamei thaumei nungc,Alleluia!",
            "Tingkauh Kaguangc bamvpaeng khou, Alleluia!",
            "Paapc mei khang keymei Khrista, Alleluia!",
            "’Taw thu tingkauh ku kan the, Alleluia!",
            "",
            "2 Rih ngammei #^7 Kata ’Khwan, Alleluia!",
            "Raenghmun guay py ngangc thau o, Alleluia!",
            "Paapc lev theihmei ta ngam the, Alleluia!",
            "Hymdaih Guangc ta tiigut ro,Alleluia!",
            "",
            "3 Zauc lo, Kabaanc zay thau the, Alleluia!",
            "Zauc lo, zianmei zamv lyanlou, Alleluia!",
            "Chu lo, Kamei ’zianmei khwan, Alleluia!",
            "Phwamling ta suaihiamloumei, Alleluia!",
            "",
            "4 ’Niw how tangh makmei Kaipouc, Alleluia!",
            "’Niw lung Nang khou phungc guang e, Alleluia!",
            "Khou 7}$ Nang zaw paanv gaanc e, Alleluia!",
            "Aniw tingkauc kiu Nang e, Alleluia!"
          ]
        }
      },
